Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Full
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.80,0:00:58.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keshite hodoke wa shinai sa
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.85,0:01:03.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep searching.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.15,0:01:08.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tadori tsuita. Kono
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.61,0:01:13.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,basho de period ni
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.07,0:01:18.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kanashii ikari.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.59,0:01:22.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shikara ni kaete
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.27,0:01:25.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.78,0:01:30.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,place
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.63,0:01:36.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is like
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.45,0:01:41.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a maze
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.49,0:01:44.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try not to get separated All right
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.49,0:01:50.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Winry, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.42,0:01:57.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm fine. What's this stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.34,0:01:59.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dynamite!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.17,0:02:04.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nah, these are all sopping wet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.66,0:02:08.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Relax, they wouldn't blow up\Neven if we wanted them to.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.08,0:02:09.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.99,0:02:11.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quit dawdling.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.50,0:02:13.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They could already be after us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.82,0:02:15.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.46,0:02:23.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The storm has finally passed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.60,0:02:26.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Start preparing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.32,0:02:27.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.18,0:02:30.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't take
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.09,0:02:32.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,any risks with Kimblee and his men, so
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.16,0:02:35.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,first chance you get, take\Nout all three of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.41,0:02:37.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right. Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.71,0:02:55.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the only ones to\Nknow of this mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.70,0:02:58.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't mention it outside of this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.72,0:02:59.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, hold on a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.77,0:03:02.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not planning on\Nkilling them, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.50,0:03:04.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Major, of course we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.68,0:03:06.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'm not gonna have any part of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.78,0:03:10.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I say we should take Kimblee\Nprisoner and try to get some answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.48,0:03:13.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you really think\Nhe'll tell us anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.16,0:03:16.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's too dangerous to live,\Nbut we don't know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.24,0:03:17.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,About his men, I mean, for all we know,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.86,0:03:21.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he could be manipulating them\Nsomehow, forcing them to obey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.00,0:03:26.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could be right, but we can't\Ntake such a risk on a possibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.70,0:03:29.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And yet you're still willing\Nto kill them for one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.30,0:03:31.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't like it was with General Raven.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.72,0:03:32.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There might be another way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.00,0:03:35.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you forgotten the\Nfirst law of Briggs?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.34,0:03:37.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The careless are the first to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.68,0:03:38.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You show mercy in this place,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.90,0:03:43.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I guarantee it's going to\Nget you or your friends killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.81,0:03:48.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are going to be careless.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.48,0:03:51.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're killing Kimblee.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.43,0:03:53.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and the two men with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.92,0:04:00.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had almost forgotten\Nthat he's just a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.95,0:04:02.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Indeed he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.35,0:04:05.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Especially if he's naive enough to\Nthink he won't have to kill anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.86,0:04:09.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I have to admit that I\Nused to think the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.60,0:04:10.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So did I.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.29,0:04:15.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But once you've lived through a couple of\Nwars like we have , you learn some things.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.90,0:04:20.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like sometimes, killing someone\Nisn't as hard as letting them live.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.24,0:04:24.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Elric brothers have certainly\Nchosen the more difficult path.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.38,0:04:27.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess they like to go against the grain.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.30,0:04:30.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but in a way, I\Nenvy their conviction.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.32,0:04:41.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this Rasayana term here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.14,0:04:43.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a miracle drug used for longevity.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.26,0:04:47.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could that be the Philosopher's Stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.34,0:04:48.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.25,0:04:50.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,says here that it can transform all metals
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.61,0:04:53.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,into gold and restore\Nyouth to the elderly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.70,0:04:56.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what does this term mean, Aurelian?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.38,0:04:58.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's another term for gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.22,0:05:01.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So these notes are centered\Naround immortality and gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.54,0:05:03.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm guessing that it's because Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.31,0:05:07.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Scar's brother was influenced by\NXingese alchemy whenever he wrote them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.60,0:05:09.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And why is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.30,0:05:11.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We refer to an immortal as a shinhito.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.10,0:05:14.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It means a true being.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.08,0:05:17.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These true beings are\Nconsidered to be perfect souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.18,0:05:18.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.09,0:05:19.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,since gold is considered\Nthe perfect metal,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.53,0:05:22.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,these beings are also\Nsometimes called "Aurelian.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.28,0:05:29.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So in other words, an immortal\Nperson is seen as a golden being.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.08,0:05:30.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In a sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.99,0:05:34.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It comes from the man who\Nbrought alchemy to S hing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.26,0:05:37.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The legend says he was an immortal\Nwith golden hair and eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.72,0:05:40.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's where the\Nterm first originated.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.36,0:05:41.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.27,0:05:44.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An alchemist with golden\Nhair and golden eyes, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.52,0:05:46.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds like Ed and Al.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.94,0:05:49.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, over here! The exit!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.65,0:05:57.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.07,0:05:59.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so bright!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.76,0:06:02.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was starting to wonder if we'd make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.38,0:06:04.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The weather's clear. For now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.15,0:06:06.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's head to Briggs\Nbefore it turns again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.54,0:06:08.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, everyone, follow my lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.80,0:06:11.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like the snow was pretty deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.90,0:06:14.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should hop on my back,\NChris, just to be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.44,0:06:15.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.35,0:06:16.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,walk ahead to stomp down the snow and make
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.56,0:06:18.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a clear path for the\Nrest of you to follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.66,0:06:20.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.50,0:06:30.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.68,0:06:32.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.61,0:06:33.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone's there!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.16,0:06:35.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help me, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.31,0:06:38.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.48,0:06:39.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.28,0:06:41.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.21,0:06:42.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.22,0:06:44.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll get you out of there!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.74,0:06:46.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You saved me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.56,0:06:49.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got stuck in the snow, and\Nthen a blizzard buried me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.92,0:06:51.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.50,0:06:54.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Al, I crossed the\Nmountain to warn you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.78,0:06:58.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You crossed over in the\Nmiddle of that snowstorm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.82,0:07:04.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you cut straight through,\Nbypassing the mine's twists and turns.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.00,0:07:07.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would you even risk that? It
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.49,0:07:09.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,was the only way to warn you,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.58,0:07:14.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,warn us about what Briggs has been\Ntaken over by troops from. Central.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.98,0:07:17.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,General Armstrong's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.04,0:07:20.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They summoned her to Central Headquarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.69,0:07:23.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll be walking right into\Ntheir hands if you go there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.36,0:07:26.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, then what are we supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.76,0:07:29.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't just hide in the mines.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.64,0:07:30.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.63,0:07:33.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll have to find someplace else.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.12,0:07:35.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But there isn't anyplace else!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.93,0:07:42.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.44,0:07:43.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are you taking us?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.06,0:07:46.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a mountain village\Ncalled Asbeck nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.41,0:07:48.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It shouldn't take us long to get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.02,0:07:51.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been told that some of\Nmy people have taken refuge.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.04,0:07:53.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in the slums there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.60,0:07:55.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And his fallen refugee camp?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.52,0:07:58.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not like we really\Nhave any other options.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.46,0:08:00.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great idea, sir...! Let's get going!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.43,0:08:07.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure about this, Al? About what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.96,0:08:10.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,isn't mr kim berly gonna\Nbe suspicious if you
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.74,0:08:15.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,just suddenly disappear it's okay don't\Nworry brother's got it all taken care of
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.68,0:08:17.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,three men in
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.59,0:08:24.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this squad there are five men in mind\Nsir each squad is ready then spread out
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.36,0:08:25.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.27,0:08:28.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,carefully search your\Ndesignated sector sir yes sir
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.29,0:08:33.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get going, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.89,0:08:35.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sir don't get carried
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.97,0:08:38.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,away alphonse there's no reason to call
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.53,0:08:41.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the major sir it's hard to move around in
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.54,0:08:44.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,here could you have\Nmade this thing lighter
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.94,0:08:49.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're strong, you can handle\Nit... C'mon... Kimblee's watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.65,0:08:53.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hurry up come on
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.29,0:09:04.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you overhear Kimblee say\Nwhere his squad is searching?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.76,0:09:07.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You saw that mine shaft in the\Ncenter of town, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.94,0:09:10.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're headed down there\Nto search the tunnels.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.42,0:09:15.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard him mention that he couldn't\Ntrust the northern soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.58,0:09:18.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so he's only taking the men\Nhe brought with him, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.60,0:09:19.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.51,0:09:22.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess he's figured us out, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.20,0:09:23.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll head them off.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.72,0:09:26.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Position snipers near the\Nopening of the mine shaft.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.56,0:09:27.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.29,0:09:32.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.63,0:09:39.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Check the entrance for tracks in the snow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.71,0:09:42.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll follow them in if\Nyou find multiple sets.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.49,0:09:43.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.42,0:09:49.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it clear? Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.47,0:09:50.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's in my sights.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.43,0:09:56.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.28,0:09:58.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Edward.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.29,0:09:59.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.29,0:10:05.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kimberly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.13,0:10:10.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should probably let the brig\Nsoldiers check the tunnels instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.33,0:10:13.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could get lost in there pretty easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.19,0:10:16.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The mere fact that you're stopping me\Nis proof that we're in the right place.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.03,0:10:18.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I know that they're down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.05,0:10:20.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And how is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.95,0:10:22.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, I want to catch Scar just...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.49,0:10:27.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're trying to buy some time for your\Nsnipers to get into position, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.79,0:10:29.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You knew about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.63,0:10:33.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can practically smell the murderous\Nintent in the air around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.81,0:10:36.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like a sixth sense I\Npicked up while in Ishval.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.09,0:10:39.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're just standing there, talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.45,0:10:40.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.19,0:10:43.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you still target Kimberley?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.41,0:10:44.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.61,0:10:48.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then aim carefully and fire. Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.05,0:10:59.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.57,0:11:01.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's using the snow to block our view!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.89,0:11:03.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.12,0:11:06.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kimblee!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.91,0:11:09.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Son of a...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.01,0:11:29.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should have guessed\Nyou guys were chimeras.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.57,0:11:31.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Full metal alchemist.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.43,0:11:34.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Full metal alchemist.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.59,0:12:04.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn you, Kimberly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.23,0:12:05.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't see anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.33,0:12:09.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But on the bright side,\Nthey can't see me either.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.05,0:12:15.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no point in trying\Nto run, Fullmetal Alchemist.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.23,0:12:17.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't hide from us here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.37,0:12:20.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We may not see you, but we can smell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.89,0:12:22.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.59,0:12:34.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Old man, what's going on in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.05,0:12:37.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Edward, answer me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.38,0:12:40.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miles, these guys are Chimeras!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.93,0:12:43.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They know how to fight in low visibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.74,0:12:44.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.71,0:12:45.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.31,0:12:57.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Owwww...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.22,0:13:00.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Falling like that's going to\Nstunt my growth even more .
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.61,0:13:04.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dynamite, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.52,0:13:07.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's one perk to fighting in a mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.92,0:13:14.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, you might want to\Nkeep your distance, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.21,0:13:17.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These aren't exactly cigars\NI'm holding. You idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.39,0:13:19.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That stuff isn't going to do you any good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.57,0:13:20.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too damp.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.51,0:13:21.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sure about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.56,0:13:24.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you happen to know\Nwhat dynamite's made of?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.85,0:13:26.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's nitroglycerin, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.89,0:13:28.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And nitroglycol.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.51,0:13:30.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And there's sawdust.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.29,0:13:32.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't there ammonium nitrate in it, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.65,0:13:33.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, there is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.91,0:13:37.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what's ammonium nitrate\Nmade out of? That's easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.45,0:13:39.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nitric acid and ammonia.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.91,0:13:47.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ammonia nitrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.97,0:13:58.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that disgusting\Nsmell? It's ammonia.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.89,0:14:01.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're downsized to having a sharp nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.57,0:14:04.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I doubt they'll be of much use to you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.81,0:14:09.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your attitude changed rather quickly,\Nnow that I've lost my hostage.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.91,0:14:11.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What'd you expect to happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.93,0:14:13.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's make this easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.19,0:14:16.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I want here is for you to\Ntell me everything you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.81,0:14:19.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, is that all you want from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.17,0:14:20.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just got out of the hospital,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.83,0:14:24.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I don't feel like getting banged\Nup fighting a young ster like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.87,0:14:28.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not to mention that I don't\Nreally have the time, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.67,0:14:31.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I'll have to\Nspeed things up with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.23,0:14:35.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least I won't have\Nto search for it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.30,0:14:40.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.17,0:14:58.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's lost his stone. And\Nhe can't transmute now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.67,0:15:00.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now I'm... Now you've what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.65,0:15:02.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think you've won?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.13,0:15:05.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're determined not to kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.53,0:15:07.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How admirable of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.51,0:15:12.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You do realize the advantage that it gives\Nyour opponent, though, now, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.27,0:15:16.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instead of finishing me off, you've\Ngiven me a second chance to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.88,0:15:23.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That sense of mercy is about to\Nget you in a lot of trouble .
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.29,0:15:31.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,AHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHH
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.60,0:15:41.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,HHHHHHHHH…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.45,0:15:59.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.87,0:16:03.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,have fallen
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.75,0:16:05.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,down the mine shaft.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.67,0:16:09.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't let
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.58,0:16:11.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kimberley.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.01,0:16:16.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.85,0:16:23.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're kidding... No.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.51,0:16:24.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.73,0:16:31.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ow,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.85,0:16:50.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.49,0:16:51.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ow, mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.79,0:16:53.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.06,0:16:55.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.25,0:16:57.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm being pulled back again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.17,0:16:59.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.08,0:16:59.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pulled back?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.99,0:17:01.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, Al?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.39,0:17:02.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with the arm again?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.30,0:17:03.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Al!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.21,0:17:04.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My body.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.39,0:17:08.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's pulling my soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.20,0:17:11.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Al!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.18,0:17:12.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Al!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.15,0:17:14.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His soul is being pulled away.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.37,0:17:17.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know if anything like this\Nhas ever happened before, Winry?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.07,0:17:18.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.05,0:17:21.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you hear me, Alpha? Al! Al!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.41,0:17:23.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.93,0:17:24.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.84,0:17:25.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Val!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.75,0:17:26.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Val!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.00,0:17:28.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.45,0:17:30.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.95,0:17:33.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.97,0:17:45.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't make her cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.17,0:17:49.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Especially not over something this stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.45,0:18:01.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.47,0:18:08.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn... Kimblee's gonna pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.45,0:18:12.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Full Metal Kid,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.51,0:18:15.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.81,0:18:18.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What made you decide to rescue us?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.23,0:18:20.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're more injured than we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.30,0:18:21.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.34,0:18:24.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't get the wrong idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.64,0:18:28.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't pull this out\Nof my stomach on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.87,0:18:31.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could use a little bit of help.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.90,0:18:37.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were enemies just five minutes ago and\Nnow you're asking us to save your life?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.61,0:18:39.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, basically.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.25,0:18:40.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.51,0:18:47.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's not like we were\Ngiven orders to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.52,0:18:48.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.64,0:18:54.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, kid, you're gonna bleed to\Ndeath pretty quickly once I pull this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.72,0:18:56.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not if I heal it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.27,0:19:01.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As soon as it's out of me, I'll close\Nup the wound with alchemy. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.93,0:19:05.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you ever performed any\Nkind of medical alchemy before?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.93,0:19:07.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sort of.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.68,0:19:12.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did some research on it when\NI tried human transmutation.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.99,0:19:14.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just some research?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.65,0:19:17.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your guts have gotta be all messed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.55,0:19:21.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're gonna need a philosopher's\Nstone to make this work.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.35,0:19:23.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna have to use my own life force.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.75,0:19:27.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the same way I would use a stone. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.27,0:19:31.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll probably take a few\Nyears off my lifespan, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.07,0:19:32.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're positive?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.98,0:19:35.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't really have\Ntime to think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.07,0:19:38.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If this is really what showing\Nmercy is gonna cost me,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.04,0:19:40.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then I'm gonna have to learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.27,0:19:42.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to pay the price, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.89,0:19:49.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what you're talking about,\Nbut it sounds like you're sure ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.04,0:19:52.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.70,0:19:58.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.36,0:20:03.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got a picture of myself\Nas a single mass of energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.20,0:20:10.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Use the energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.79,0:20:12.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like the stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.44,0:20:16.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.54,0:20:18.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am a philosopher's stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.54,0:20:20.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's powered by a single soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.74,0:20:27.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember... What it felt like...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.62,0:20:30.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like at that moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.16,0:20:32.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.08,0:20:38.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How it felt to use souls! To harness life!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.96,0:20:58.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did he make it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.96,0:21:02.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't kill me that easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.08,0:21:05.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Easily, oh, you mean it worked well?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.38,0:21:07.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't exactly say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.58,0:21:08.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm healed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.52,0:21:14.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I rejoined my undamaged organs, and\NI've managed to stop the bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.25,0:21:16.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it won't last for long.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.57,0:21:19.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, then you need a real... doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.21,0:21:22.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I don't have time for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.38,0:21:23.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.29,0:21:28.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I've got to stop Kimblee\Nbefore he gets to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.06,0:21:33.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.97,0:21:38.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way you can fight\NKimblee in your condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.52,0:21:43.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.00,0:21:45.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The stone, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.54,0:21:46.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.66,0:21:49.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kimberley must have lost it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.92,0:21:55.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quit calling that freak "Mister." He's not\Nour boss, not since he almost killed us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.09,0:21:56.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.48,0:21:59.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about we make our\Nresignation official?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.46,0:22:04.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's just hold on to our freedom and let\Nthe bastard think we died in the rubble.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.23,0:22:07.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, what do we do with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.58,0:22:11.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't just leave him here to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.29,0:22:14.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We do owe him our lives after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.36,0:22:15.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very true.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.38,0:22:21.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First things first, we gotta\Nfind him a doctor, right."
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.00,0:22:41.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.48,0:22:44.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,be
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.76,0:22:51.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,right
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.50,0:22:59.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,back.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.00,0:23:11.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.48,0:23:14.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,be
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.81,0:23:21.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,right
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.44,0:23:29.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,back.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.23,0:23:41.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.27,0:23:59.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,situation may
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.27,0:24:00.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,seem to be unstoppable,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.58,0:24:03.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but the unexpected lies in wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.28,0:24:06.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,planning to forge its own\Npath and alter the outcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.00,0:24:10.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Victory only promises itself to the\None who's capable of seeing the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.92,0:24:13.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and patient enough to\Nunderstand its meaning.
